{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38839","headline":"和刘评事送海禅和归山 · 杜荀鹤","name":"和刘评事送海禅和归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衲外元无象，言寻那路寻。\n问禅将底说，传印得何心。\n未了羣山浅，难休一室深。\n伏魔宁是兽，巢顶亦非禽。\n观色风驱雾，听声雪洒林。\n凡归是归处，不必指高岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}